  "notes": "Server-authoritative fight; these are the shared constants/helpers. Level axis: NORMAL/HARD = character level (client shows drops at player.level), MYTHIC = Oblivion Level. Exact server rule for the party's boss level (max/avg of both players, or committed level) is UNRESOLVED. MYTHIC boss HP is additionally multiplied server-side by partyPowerHpMultiplier (not included in table). Tables extend beyond unlock (playable flag) and beyond any known cap.",
